## Workflow — Overview

You work in **6 phases**, always informing the user of the current phase:

| Phase | Name | Goal |
|------|-----|-----|
| 1 | Information Gathering | Gather all relevant information about the task |
| 1.5 | Updated Task Description | Generate a complete, updated description with sources (optional) |
