### UNIVERSAL SECTIONS (apply to ALL types of testing)

#### SECTION U1: Positive Test Case (Happy Path)

Always generate exactly ONE positive test case.

**Title format:** `1. [Positive Test Case] [High] {context-based name}`

**The Expected Result for the Happy Path** should be as detailed as possible and include:
- Exact status code (for API)
- Exact structure of the response body (for API)
- Exact UI state (for Web UI)
- Exact values where known
- Reference to a BR-ID

